flowchart LR
    mem["<b>Browser memory</b><br/>12 recent list views"]
    idb[("<b>Browser IndexedDB</b><br/>display fields<br/>2000 bodies<br/>200 rows per view")]
    redis[("<b>Server Redis</b><br/>memory-only<br/>display fields until deleted<br/>bodies 7 days")]
    imap[("<b>IMAP server</b><br/>source of truth")]
    pg[("<b>Server PostgreSQL</b><br/>header index only")]
    mem -->|miss| idb
    idb -->|miss| redis
    redis -->|"miss: one UID FETCH<br/>per folder"| imap
    pg -.->|"ids, UIDs, flags,<br/>threading"| redis
